land card is revealed this way."""@en .
:FaceAVillainousChoice rdf:type :KeywordAction ;
                       rdfs:label "Face a Villainous Choice" ;
                       rdfs:comment """A keyword action that causes a player to
choose one of two listed choices."""@en .
:Fateseal rdf:type :KeywordAction ;
          rdfs:label "Fateseal" ;
          rdfs:comment """To manipulate some of the cards on top of an
opponent’s library."""@en .
:Fight rdf:type :KeywordAction ;
       rdfs:label "Fight" ;
       rdfs:comment """A keyword action where each of two creatures deals damage
equal to its power to the other."""@en .
:Forage rdf:type :KeywordAction ;
        rdfs:label "Forage" ;
        rdfs:comment """To pay a cost of exiling three cards from your graveyard
